# Gwenom, Remorseless is cast on turn one and attacks on turn three. With its trigger on the stack Bot1 may neither look at
# the top card of its library nor cast the Lightning Bolt there. Once it resolves, Bot1 may look (CR 401.2) and casts the
# Bolt off the top for 1 life, its mana value, rather than {R}; the Shock on top of Bot2's library stays Bot2's (the effect
# says "your library"). Gwenom's 4 lifelink damage takes Bot1 to 23. In the second main phase Bot1 plays Tundra, the new
# top card, as its land for the turn. On turn five the effect has ended ("until end of turn"): no look, and the second
# Bolt on top can't be cast.

